# License scope

- Tools, tests and technical documentation: **MIT**, see `LICENSES/MIT.txt`.
- The English province descriptions and their Simplified Chinese versions: **CC BY-SA 4.0**, see `LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt` and https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/.

The description licence covers the `en` and `zh` fields of `data/entries.jsonl` and the resulting `eu4lg_text_*` values in the built localisation files. Credit the **Descriptions for Every Province contributors**, keep the per-province source links in `sources/sources.jsonl`, say what you changed, and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or a compatible licence.

The descriptions are AI-assisted summaries written from the consulted sources, mostly Wikipedia in English and the local language; they are not copies of those pages or of official EU4 text. The licences grant only what the contributors can grant. Facts, province IDs and other interoperability identifiers are not claimed. Paradox game files (including the vanilla province window definition this mod extends), trademarks and third-party material are not relicensed. The cover and thumbnail are described in `workshop/assets/README.md` and are not covered by either licence. See `CREDITS.md`.
